h to become a standing rule. Use May 2024 as the new evidence point rather th=
an recycling the earlier conclusion. Please work towards whether this is an i=
solated exception, a design weakness or a control operating failure. A useful=
 output would be a short decision pack with no more than five slides and an a=
ttached evidence table.

